<section id="A1.SS3.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.3 </span>Results of Accuracy Comparison Across Different Models</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table A5 ‣ A.3.3 Results of Accuracy Comparison Across Different Models ‣ A.3 Additional Experimental Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ On the Faithfulness of Visual Thinking: Measurement and Enhancement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A5</span></a> reports the accuracy results of SEAL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wu &amp; Xie (2024)</a></cite>, DeepEye <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al. (2025)</a></cite>, Pixel-Reasoner <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">Su et al. (2025a)</a></cite>, and our SCCM-based RFT model on <span id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">V*</span> Bench and HR-Bench. The evaluation covers all data samples from these benchmarks, including both MCoT and non-MCoT reasoning cases.
Our model achieves state-of-the-art performance on the majority of evaluated tasks, particularly on the <span id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">V*</span> Bench and HR-Bench 8K. Furthermore, it demonstrates a clear and significant improvement over our primary baseline, <em id="A1.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">i.e.</em>, Pixel-Reasoner.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_rr ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Model</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_rr ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">V*</span> Bench</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_rr ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;" colspan="3">HR-Bench 4K</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;" colspan="3">HR-Bench 8K</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"><span id="A1.T5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Attr.</span></td>
